cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Mem-Forever, please cite it as below."
title: "Mem-Forever: a Git-native persistent memory layer for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  Every AI tool forgets a user when the session closes. Mem-Forever keeps the
  memory in the user's own Git repository as compact I-Lang structures that a
  person can read and a machine can parse, so preferences, decisions and
  lessons survive across sessions, tools and models. It needs no installation
  and no configuration: fork the repository and point the agent at it.
  Documentation in nine languages.
